<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83830" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληροφορ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring full measure: satisfy fully,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PAmh.
				2.66.42
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
				121.910
			</span></i>; esp. <i>assure,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ὅρκοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ctes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					29.39
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i>Cod Just.</i><i><span class="en">
				1.1.7.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fulfil,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν διακονίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Ti.</u>
					4.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πατρῷον συνάλλαγμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
					5.383
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i/ii A. D.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be fulfilled,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Luc.
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				43.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>pay in full,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1473.8
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			, <span class="entity">iii A. D.</span>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of persons, <i>have full satisfaction, to be fully
				assured,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτι . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
					4.21
				</span></i>
			: abs., ib.<i><span class="en">
				14.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῦ ποιῆσαι</span>
			<i>to be fully bent on</i> doing, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ec.</u>
				8.11
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
